WEBVTT

00:00:01.311 --> 00:00:03.814
Good afternoon, Harry.

00:00:05.941 --> 00:00:10.445
- Tokens from your admirers?
- Admirers?

00:00:10.612 --> 00:00:16.618
What happened in the dungeons between
you and professor quirrell is a secret.

00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:21.623
So, naturally, the whole school knows.

00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:27.629
I see that your friend Ronald
has saved you the trouble...

00:00:27.838 --> 00:00:30.632
Of opening your chocolate frogs.

00:00:30.882 --> 00:00:33.885
Ron was here? Is he all right?
What about Hermione?

00:00:34.094 --> 00:00:38.974
Fine. They're both just fine.

00:00:39.558 --> 00:00:42.352
- What happened to the stone?
- Relax, dear boy.

00:00:42.644 --> 00:00:45.480
The stone has been destroyed.

00:00:45.772 --> 00:00:49.985
My friend Nicholas and I
have had a little chat...

00:00:50.152 --> 00:00:54.156
And agreed it was best all around.

00:00:54.364 --> 00:00:58.160
But then, flamel,
he'll die, won't he?

00:01:00.245 --> 00:01:05.751
He has enough elixir
to set his affairs in order.

00:01:05.959 --> 00:01:09.171
But yes, he will die.

00:01:09.379 --> 00:01:11.840
How is it I got the stone, sir?

00:01:12.007 --> 00:01:14.593
One minute I was staring
in the mirror and...

00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:18.889
You see, only a person...

00:01:19.181 --> 00:01:23.101
Who wanted to find the stone,
find it...

00:01:23.351 --> 00:01:27.898
But not use it,
would be able to get it.

00:01:28.857 --> 00:01:32.360
That is one of my more brilliant ideas.

00:01:32.527 --> 00:01:37.616
And between you and me,
that is saying something.

00:01:39.034 --> 00:01:44.289
Does that mean, with the stone gone,
that Voldemort can never come back?

00:01:44.498 --> 00:01:46.833
I'm afraid...

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:52.297
There are ways
in which he can return.

00:01:53.006 --> 00:01:55.550
Harry, do you know why...

00:01:55.801 --> 00:01:59.805
Professor quirrell couldn't bear
to have you touch him?

00:02:00.013 --> 00:02:04.643
It was because of your mother.
She sacrificed herself for you.

00:02:05.185 --> 00:02:08.396
And that kind of act leaves a Mark.

00:02:08.563 --> 00:02:12.400
No, this kind of Mark cannot be seen.

00:02:12.567 --> 00:02:17.531
- It lives in your very skin.
- What is it?

00:02:18.365 --> 00:02:22.077
Love, Harry. Love.

00:02:30.168 --> 00:02:34.256
Bertie bott's every flavor beans.

00:02:34.506 --> 00:02:39.177
I was most unfortunate in my youth
to come across a vomit-flavored one.

00:02:39.427 --> 00:02:42.722
And since then,
I've lost my liking for them.

00:02:42.931 --> 00:02:46.268
But I think I could be safe...

00:02:46.518 --> 00:02:48.895
With a nice toffee.

00:02:51.606 --> 00:02:54.526
Hm, alas!

00:02:55.235 --> 00:02:57.362
Eannax.

00:03:12.586 --> 00:03:15.755
- All right there, Ron?
- All right. You?

00:03:16.882 --> 00:03:19.593
All right. Hermione?

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:22.095
Never better.
